{
  "name": "Beguiling Shot",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your enchantment magic causes this projectile to temporarily beguile its target. The creature hit by the projectile takes D6 x Proficiency extra psychic damage, and choose one of your allies within 30 feet of the target. The target must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw, or it is Charmed by the chosen ally for 1 minute. The target can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
